    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You broadcast a broad-spectrum jamming field that disrupts incoming tech-based attacks against your allies.</p><p>You project a <strong>20-foot interference aura</strong> for <strong>1 minute</strong>. The first time each round that any tech power would affect a friendly creature within the aura, it automatically <strong>fails</strong> (the attacker's action is wasted). Non-tech attacks and biotic powers are unaffected. Dismiss as a free action.</p><p><em>Prerequisite: Superior Sentinel Mastery. Classes: Sentinel.</em></p>"
